        "\n",
        "\n",
        "Thank you for visiting your Space Travel Benefits Portal. It is imperative that you read all information displayed below to make the most informed decisions regarding your next steps (in or out of space)\n",
        "\n",
        "[Following your recent extinction level event (see news on Universal War 4 Nuclear Fallout), we are offering subsidized space immigration services to Earthian refugees born within the bounds of the United States as support to those still on the planet. It is highly advised that you leave as soon as possible, given the continued escalation of violence against Earth perpetrated by the government of JKPSI-200.]{style=\"color: red;\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "[Please fill out the rest of your personal information below. Please understand that this is not a binding document, and by filling this out, you confirm that the US Government is not liable for any trauma, injury, or mishaps caused by the decisions you make going forward, intra or extra terrestrially.]{style=\"color: navy;\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "*Your location has already been collected via GPS Tracking.*\n"
      ],
